+"""Self-contained problem generator for arXiv:1205.0852.
+
+The paper defines WSP entailment constraints using arbitrary binary relations on
+the user set. This module uses Type-1 modular-difference relations. It chooses
+an affine plan first, then builds a connected set of relations around that plan.
+"""
