codex
The local gates pass on the revised family: 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses; all five heuristic attacks fail on 8/8 seeds; Hopcroft–Karp succeeds on 8/8 as Track B requires; and the canonical key survives composed step/user renaming plus affine coordinate changes on 20/20 seeds. At shipping size, matching averages 13,859 edge scans versus a 300-field-operation row-sum route.
