codex
Two independent bare oracles solved the easy preset before the shared key exhausted on the third draw, so the easy rung is genuinely too easy and cannot ship. I’m inspecting those replies to identify whether they found the row-sum invariant or merely executed matching; then I’ll slide the ladder upward locally while preserving the script-owned transcript evidence.
