codex
The solved replies exposed the weakness precisely: both returned a plain arithmetic progression, so they never had to map the invariant back through the workflow’s labels. I’m removing that output-order shortcut by independently permuting intrinsic step residues. The certificate remains a native plan, every edge still lies on an affine perfect matching, and the compact route remains under the operation cap—but its final plan is no longer visually guessable.
apply patch
